        ['q' => 'What is a WPI-8 and do I need one after roof repairs?', 'a' => '<p>A WPI-8 is TDI\'s Certificate of Compliance for windstorm construction in the TWIA catastrophe area. Repairs, including re-roofs and roof repairs, generally must be inspected and certified to stay eligible for TWIA coverage. See our <a href="/local-building-codes/">Port Arthur building codes</a> page.</p>'],
