        ['q' => 'My home had both wind and flood damage. How is that handled?', 'a' => '<p>Usually as separate claims: wind with TWIA or your homeowners insurer and rising water with your flood insurer, each with its own adjuster and deductible. Clear documentation of what each cause damaged, such as high-water lines and roof openings, matters a great deal. Read <a href="/wind-vs-flood-damage-port-arthur-insurance/">wind vs. flood damage in Port Arthur</a>.</p>'],
